            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Bagel Meter 1.4

- New **Grouped** view: all your accounts in one list, sorted into Ready (most room first), On credits, and Zeroed (soonest back first). One line per account.
- The Compact checkbox is now a **View** menu at the bottom: Regular, Compact or Grouped. Your choice is saved on your Mac, so everyone picks their own.
]]></description>
